    eli:first_date_entry_in_force "2022-10-22"^^xsd:date ;
    eli:date_no_longer_in_force "2022-12-31"^^xsd:date ;
    eli:date_applicability "2022-10-22"^^xsd:date ;
    tlx:openApplicabilityEnd tlx:NotExtracted ;
    eli:is_realized_by <sluzbeni/2022/119/1834/art_107/v/2022-10-22/hrv> ;
    rdfs:comment "In force up to and including 31 December 2022 (Art. 121(3)). Article 121(3) states when Article 107 ceases to be in force, but the included sources do not state until when it is applied to cases that arose while it was in force. That depends on rules outside the graph, so the end of applicability is recorded as not extracted rather than copied from the end of legal force."@en .

