    rdfs:comment "Art. 121(1) of OG 119/2022: the former act ceases to be in force on the entry into force of the new act. Versions of the former act are not modelled."@en .

<event/2023-01-01/euro-introduction>
    a tlx:ChangeEvent ;
    tlx:eventType tlx:ExternalEvent ;
    tlx:date "2023-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    tlx:causedBy <https://narodne-novine.nn.hr/eli/sluzbeni/2022/119/1834> ;
    tlx:opens <sluzbeni/2022/119/1834/art_108/v/2023-01-01> ;
    tlx:opensApplicability <sluzbeni/2022/119/1834/art_108/v/2023-01-01> ;
    tlx:closes <sluzbeni/2022/119/1834/art_107/v/2022-10-22> ;
    rdfs:label "Introduction of the euro as the official currency of Croatia"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "One external event with effects prescribed in two provisions of OG 119/2022, which is therefore given as CAUSED_BY: it opens Article 108 (Art. 122) and ends the legal force of Article 107 (Art. 121(3)). It does not close the applicability of Article 107."@en .

